msgid "Unknown application"
msgstr "Aplacaid neo-aithnichte"

msgid "No AT-SPI-exposed shortcuts found for this application.\nGTK app? Try Ctrl+? — many bind their own shortcuts window to it."
msgstr "Cha deach ath-ghoiridean a nochdas AT-SPI a lorg airson na h-aplacaid seo.\nAplacaid GTK a th' ann? Feuch Ctrl+? — bidh mòran a' ceangal an uinneag ath-ghoiridean fhèin ris."
